            },
            "description": "Your forecasting technique fails to account for outliers (e.g., stockouts), promotions, product launches, and seasonality, leading to stockouts or overstocking during spikes and lulls.\u00a0",
            "heading": "Inaccurate forecasting"
           },
           {
            "add_image": {
